#LightAmbient   Intensity ( R G B )             Indicator ( X Y Z ) ( Z0 X1 Y2 )
#LightDirection Intensity ( R G B ) ( X Y Z )   Indicator ( X Y Z )
#LightPoint     Intensity ( R G B ) ( X Y Z )   Indicator ( Z0 X1 Y2 )
#LightSpot      Intensity ( R G B ) ( X Y Z ) ( X Y Z )

#LightAmbient      0.4   1.0 1.0 1.0     0.0 40.0   0.0   0.0 0.0 0.0
#LightDirectionD   0.8   1.0 1.0 1.0    +1.0 -3.0  +2.0   0.0 45.0 0.0

LightAmbient      0.0   1.0 1.0 1.0     0.0 40.0   0.0   0.0 0.0 0.0
LightDirectionD   0.0   1.0 1.0 1.0    +1.0 -3.0  +2.0   0.0 45.0 0.0



pallet Palette.polyhedra palette
place palette   0 0 -20   00 00 00

pallet BlumenTopf.polyhedra              blume_topf
pallet BlumenTopfUnterSetzer.polyhedra   blume_untersetzer
place blume_topf          -3.35 1.55 -25   00 00 00
place blume_untersetzer   -3.35 1.50 -25   00 00 00

pallet Leitkegel.polyhedra leitkegel
place leitkegel   +2.75 1.5 -25   00 00 00

pallet LeuchtStoffLampeT8.polyhedra lampe_T8
place lampe_T8   3.0 1.5 -20   00 00 00
place lampe_T8   3.4 1.5 -20   00 00 00
place lampe_T8   3.2 1.7 -20   00 00 00

pallet Leuchtstofflampe.polyhedra lampe
place lampe   0 10 -20   00 00 00
LightPoint        0.5   1.0 1.0 1.0     0.0 08.0 -20.0   0.0 0.0 0.0
# Light Reflection stuff looks different from -Z and +Z
# this should not be the case
